  - type: 0
    text: "Two raiders flank the glade - one west at (-2, 0) and a marksman far east at (3, 0). A Druid commands the battlefield itself to crush scattered foes at once!"
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Select your Druid at (0, -1).
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 15
  - type: 2
    text: Right-click the Druid's Unique Passive (Nature's Force).
    tutorialTargetId: PSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: "After casting Pull!, Nature's Force empowers your Druid's next Thorns Attack to strike EVERY non-ally cell across her entire left-and-right weapon span!"
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: "Druids step exclusively onto upper or lower rows - never straight sideways. Move north onto (0, 0) between both foes!"
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Confirm your Druid's step.
    tutorialTargetId: ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 2.5
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Select your Druid at (0, 0).
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 2
    text: Right-click her Class Skill (Pull!) to inspect its vines.
    tutorialTargetId: CSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 0
    text: "Pull! is a Half-Instant skill - for 1 SP, it immediately drags a distant foe 2 or 3 tiles away right beside your Druid and awakens Nature's Force for her next turn!"
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 6
    text: Left-click Pull! to snare the distant marksman.
    tutorialTargetId: CSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Target the far-right marksman 3 tiles away at (3, 0).
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 3, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: Confirm Pull! Watch the vines drag him onto (1, 0) as the Timeline advances!
    tutorialTargetId: ConfirmButton
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 3
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 1
    text: "Both foes now stand inside your horizontal thorn span - at (-2, 0) and (1, 0) - with Nature's Force glowing! Select your Druid."
    tutorialTargetId: Unit1
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 25
  - type: 6
    text: Left-click Thorns Attack! to unleash the sweeping brambles.
    tutorialTargetId: WSKILL
    targetCell: {x: 0, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
  - type: 3
    text: Target (1, 0) - Nature's Force will lash every non-ally tile in range simultaneously!
    tutorialTargetId: 
    targetCell: {x: 1, y: 0}
    delay: 0
    targetWaitTimeout: 10
